  'aviso.v12Lendaria': '🏆 <b>500 invites = PERMANENT VIP.</b> The only reward in the game that never expires — plus 10,000 Beast Balls and a month of EVERY boost.',

  'aviso.v12ComoTitulo': 'How to start scoring today',
  'aviso.v12Passo1T': '1. Create YOUR own invite link',
  'aviso.v12Passo1': 'In Discord, right-click the channel → <b>Invite People</b> → <b>Edit invite link</b> → tick <b>Never expire</b> and <b>No limit</b>. <b>The server-wide link counts for nobody</b> — only the link YOU created knows the person is yours.',
  'aviso.v12Passo2T': '2. Share it wherever you like',
