  'tm.infoBtn': 'How TMs work',
  'tm.infoTitulo': 'TM Disk guide',
  'tm.infoIntro': 'TMs are <b>permanent</b> upgrades on a pokémon. Farm boss pieces, trade them here for disks and apply on the <b>Apply disk</b> tab — the disk leaves your bag and stays on that pokémon forever.',
  'tm.infoSecAplicado': 'When applied',
  'tm.infoElemental': '<b>Elemental disk</b> — your pokémon learns a new special move (<b>TM {tipo}</b>): power <b>2800</b>, <b>60 s</b> cooldown, <b>3×3</b> area on the target. It rotates in combat with the species\' normal moves.',
  'tm.infoAoe': '<b>AoE disk</b> — <b>all</b> of the pokémon\'s moves hit in a <b>wide area</b> (11×11, centered on the hero). Several nearby wilds take damage <b>at the same time</b> on every hit. Stacks with elemental on the same pokémon.',
  'tm.infoSecTokens': 'Bronze Boss Token',
  'tm.infoTokens': 'Boss arenas cost <b>1× Bronze Boss Token</b>. Not sold by the NPC — rare <b>Outland</b> drop ({pct} per kill, ~{media} defeats on average). Kanto and Orre do not drop it. Price is set by players on the Market.',
  'tm.infoSecPecas': 'Pieces → disks',
  'tm.infoPecasIntro': 'Defeat bosses and collect <b>{n}</b> matching pieces to trade for <b>1 disk</b> (consumed immediately):',
  'tm.infoViraElemental': 'Elemental disk',
  'tm.infoViraElementalSub': 'of the pokémon’s type',
  'tm.infoViraAoeSub': 'any species',
  'tm.infoSecTipos': 'Which TM for which pokémon?',
  'tm.infoTipos': 'An <b>elemental</b> disk only applies if its <b>type</b> matches one of the pokémon\'s types (primary or secondary). Each pokémon gets <b>one</b> elemental — choose wisely. E.g. <b>Gengar</b> (Ghost/Poison) accepts <b>Ghost</b> or <b>Poison</b>. The <b>AoE</b> disk works on any species (one per pokémon).',
  'tm.infoTiposPk': 'Pokémon selected on Apply tab: compatible elemental disks — <b>{tipos}</b>.',
  'tm.infoSecAvancado': 'Advanced content',
  'tm.infoAvancado': 'Wilds in <b>Outland</b> (trainer Lv 150+) and <b>Orre</b> (Lv 500+) have enhanced stats — more HP and damage than Kanto. In <b>Orre</b>, your active pokémon needs <b>both</b> TMs (elemental + AoE) to hunt efficiently; you can enter without them, but you will struggle.',
  'tm.compatTipos': 'Compatible elemental disks: {tipos}',
  'tm.compatAoe': 'AoE disk: any species (one per pokémon).',
  'tm.jaTemAmbos': 'elemental {tipo} + AoE',

