  'calc.combateNota': 'The score measures birth strength: <b>quality</b>, <b>IV</b> (1–32 per stat), <b>potency</b> and <b>shiny</b>. Evolving does not drop a strong birth. Physical moves use ATK/DEF; special moves use Sp.ATK/Sp.DEF; <b>base Speed</b> with the <b>SPD IV</b> shortens moves (up to 7%), and the SPD IV also speeds up the basic attack (−0.01 s to −0.32 s). Ranking ⚔ uses the same strength × level.',
