  'guild.pvpGpDetalhe': 'Placing is by <b>score</b>, from 0 to 100: up to <b>{ps}</b> for surviving — {ps} ÷ √ of the position the guild fell in, counting from the last one standing: the last one gets {ps}, 2nd {s2}, 10th {s10} — and up to <b>{pc}</b> for knockouts — {pc} ÷ √ of the guild\'s position in Pokémon knocked out: the one with the most gets {pc}, 2nd {c2}, 10th {c10}; no knockouts, 0. GP comes from the placing — e.g. 20 guilds → 1st +20, 2nd +19 … last +1.',
