  'orbs.avisoIrreversivel': 'Check the address and network carefully. A blockchain transfer CANNOT be undone.',
  'orbs.riscoTitulo': 'Before dealing with real money, read this:',
  'orbs.riscoRmt': 'The game <b>allows</b> trading items and pokémon between players for real value (RMT) — that is what the Community Market is for. You are not breaking any rule by using it.',
  'orbs.riscoGolpe': 'The project <b>is not responsible for scams between players</b> and does not arbitrate disputes: deals made outside the Market, broken promises or a wrong purchase (item, amount or price) cannot be undone by us.',
  'orbs.riscoEndereco': 'A deposit sent to an address other than the one provided, or a withdrawal requested to the wrong wallet, <b>is money lost</b>. This is not our policy: a blockchain transaction has no chargeback. Check the address and the network before confirming.',
  'orbs.notaReenvio': 'A failed withdrawal can only be resent after {min} min, and the server first checks on-chain whether the original transfer landed — nothing is ever paid twice.',
  'orbs.avisoVarredura':
    'When you deposit, USDT lands first in an address that is <b>yours alone</b> — that is how we know the payment is yours. <b>Every day, around 4:00 UTC</b>, we sweep those amounts into the project wallet to pay withdrawals and save network fees. If you just deposited, the project wallet may still be waiting for that sweep: your withdrawal joins the queue and goes out as soon as there is balance, usually <b>by the next run</b>.',
  'loja.semOrbs': 'not enough Gems',
